# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 13. EXCEL IMPORT (CHUNK-BASED)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

FLOW:
  1. POST /products/import → ProductService::importExcel()
     - Lưu file vào local disk (imports/{sessionId}.xlsx)
     - Đếm rows → tính totalChunks (50 rows/chunk)
     - Cache meta: import_meta_{sessionId}
     - Return: {session_id, total_chunks, total_rows}

  2. POST /products/import/process-chunk → ProductService::processImportChunk()
     - Đọc chunk theo {chunk_index, session_id}
     - Gom nhóm rows theo tên sản phẩm
     - Gọi ProductsImport::processProductGroup()
     - Chunk cuối: xóa file, xóa cache

CLASSES:
  - App\Imports\ProductsRowImport  → đọc raw rows theo offset
  - App\Imports\ProductsImport     → xử lý nghiệp vụ từng product group
  - App\Exports\ProductsTemplateExport → file mẫu Excel


