# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 16. AFFILIATE SYSTEM
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

MODELS: AffiliateClick, AffiliateConversion, AffiliateWithdrawal
SERVICE: AffiliateService.php
REPOSITORIES: AffiliateClickRepository, AffiliateConversionRepository,
              AffiliateWithdrawalRepository, AffiliateRepository

FLOW:
  1. User đăng ký affiliate → có affiliate_code trong users table
  2. Visitor click link ?ref={affiliate_code} → POST /api/affiliate/track-click
  3. Visitor đặt hàng → AffiliateConversion (status: pending)
  4. Đơn hàng 'delivered' → AffiliateConversion approved (cron job)
  5. Affiliate request withdrawal → Admin duyệt → paid

COMMISSION: Tính % trên grand_total, lưu trong AffiliateConversion


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 17. FRONTEND CONVENTIONS
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

AXIOS INSTANCE:
  File: frontend/src/axios.js (DUY NHẤT, không tạo instance khác)
  - baseURL: VITE_API_URL hoặc {protocol}//{hostname}:8383/api
  - JWT: Bearer token từ authStore hoặc sessionStorage
  - Auto refresh token khi 401 (dùng failedQueue pattern)
  - FormData: tự xóa Content-Type (để browser set multipart boundary)

IMPORT trong service:
  import api from '@/axios';   // ĐÚNG — @ alias trỏ src/
  // KHÔNG: import axios from 'axios' và tạo instance mới

SERVICE PATTERN (authService.js):
  ```js
  import api from '@/axios';

  export const authService = {
    login(payload) {
      return api.post('/login', payload);
    },
    // ...
  };
  ```

STORE PATTERN (Pinia composition API):
  ```js
  import { ref, computed } from 'vue';
  import { defineStore } from 'pinia';
  import { someService } from '@/services/someService';

  export const useSomeStore = defineStore('some', () => {
    const items   = ref([]);
    const loading = ref(false);
    const error   = ref(null);

    async function fetchItems(params = {}) {
      loading.value = true;
      error.value   = null;
      try {
        const res = await someService.getItems(params);
        items.value = res.data.data;
      } catch (e) {
        error.value = e.response?.data?.message || 'Lỗi không xác định';
      } finally {
        loading.value = false;
      }
    }

    return { items, loading, error, fetchItems };
  });
  ```

AUTH STORE (frontend/src/stores/auth.js):
  - token: ref('') — JWT access token
  - user: ref(null) — {user_id, full_name, email, role, avatar_url, ...}
  - Persist: sessionStorage (KHÔNG dùng localStorage)
  - hydrate(): khôi phục session khi app load
  - setSession(token, user): lưu sau login
  - clearSession(): logout, xóa storage
  - logout(): gọi API logout rồi clearSession()
  - ADMIN_ROLES: ['admin', 'seller', 'staff']

ROUTER (frontend/src/router/):
  - Route names: 'home', 'admin', 'admin-pos', 'admin-product', ...
  - Auth guard: check isAuthenticated + role trước khi vào admin routes
  - Redirect sau login: getDefaultRouteForRole(role)

SESSION SYNC (frontend/src/sessionSync.js):
  - Multi-tab logout: BroadcastChannel 'ocean_session'
  - broadcastLogout(): gửi event tất cả tab
  - Khi nhận logout event → clearSession() + redirect /client/login


